device 1 close
pre-erase off
label case asis
set postscript ppi 800
frame coordinates 10 10 99 99 
char size 1
label size 3
tic mark label size 3
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank
device 2 postscript
skip 1
read tcex1.dat x yt y pred
xlabel Temperature
y1label Voltage
xlimits 100 600
ylimits 0 2000
tic offset units data
xtic offset 10 10
ytic offset 30 30
plot y x
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat mstcex1.ps
quit
